@startuml Walker and validating

control fp.Walk
collections fileCh

control exifreader #LightCoral
collections exifCh #LightCoral

box GateKeeper #LightSkyBlue
control validator
control gorm
control decorator
end box
collections itemCh


activate fp.Walk
note over fp.Walk, fileCh #LightGreen
Make group of files by name <b>[]FileEntry,
First element is main file, others sidecars
Sends new/changed groups and groups whose
item is not Ready (new, Dirty, interrupted)
An unreadable subdirectory is skipped and recorded
end note
fp.Walk -> fileCh: new group
deactivate fp.Walk
activate fileCh
fileCh -> exifreader: new group
deactivate fileCh
activate exifreader #LightCoral
exifreader -> exifCh: exif...
note over fileCh, exifCh #LightCoral
As soon as it takes list of files
Better to merge exifreader with validator
To be able to check whole group in a row
<b>Code:</b> the validator runs inside the exif step
(exifExtractor.processMeta)
end note
deactivate exifreader
activate exifCh #LightCoral
exifCh -> validator: exif...
deactivate exifCh
activate validator

validator -> gorm: hash(path,\nexif...\nbytesize)
deactivate validator
activate gorm

alt found the same
    note over validator, gorm: same path and same hash\ndo nothing
    gorm ->x validator: <font color=red><b>nil

else found moved
    note over validator, gorm
    same hash, different path,
    old path <b><font color=red>not exists
    The item may be deleted already (finalize ran
    first: the chain is async) -> restored as Dirty
    end note
    gorm <- gorm: update path, new file rows\ntake the item's GUID
    gorm -> validator: <font color=blue><b>existing guid

else don't found
    note over validator, gorm
    path and hash not found
    create new item
    end note
    note over validator, gorm
    same hash, different path,
    old path <b><font color=red>also exists
    create new one (duplicate)
    end note
    gorm <- gorm: create
    gorm -> validator: <font color=green><b>new guid
    activate validator

else found changed
    note over validator, gorm
    same path, different hash
    <b>have to regenerate thumbs
    end note
    gorm -> validator: <font color=blue><b>existing guid
    deactivate gorm

end

validator -> decorator: guid, exif...
deactivate validator
activate decorator
decorator -> itemCh: exif{} 
deactivate decorator
note over itemCh #LightGreen: closer: item <b>Ready</b> (Processing once the transcoder exists)

== end of walk (after the last group is stored) ==

note over fp.Walk, gorm #LightGreen
Only after a <b>complete</b> walk with files found
(not on cancel, missing root, empty root)
Files with CheckTime older than this run, under the root,
not under an unreadable directory, are gone:
- main file gone -> item <b>Deleted</b> (soft delete, hidden from /items)
- sidecar gone -> item <b>Dirty</b> (re-emitted by the next walk)
- file rows deleted
end note

@enduml